## SQ-BRA-04 | tier tag members
@group A
@commands Tag probes: `/execute if block` or block tag dump for `framedblocks:framed_cube` and `copycats:copycat_block` in `#blockrunner:surface/camouflage`; `create_confectionery:chocolate_bricks` in `confectionery`; `metalfences:*` in `metal`; `create:mechanical_press` in `machinery`; `handcrafted:oak_counter_1` in `furniture`; `vintagedelight:strawberry_jam_block` in `very_sticky`; `upgrade_aquatic:coralstone` in `natural_smooth`
@pass each in that tier
@fails camouflage holding only 2: Common jar without the `has.js` fix
@from batches/r1111/a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest tagsof framedblocks:framed_cube
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=framedblocks:framed_cube .*block_tags=\S*\bblockrunner:surface/camouflage\b
> cdevtest tagsof copycats:copycat_block
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=copycats:copycat_block .*block_tags=\S*\bblockrunner:surface/camouflage\b
> cdevtest tagsof create_confectionery:chocolate_bricks
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=create_confectionery:chocolate_bricks .*block_tags=\S*\bblockrunner:surface/confectionery\b
> cdevtest tagsof create:mechanical_press
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=create:mechanical_press .*block_tags=\S*\bblockrunner:surface/machinery\b
> cdevtest tagsof handcrafted:oak_counter_1
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=handcrafted:oak_counter_1 .*block_tags=\S*\bblockrunner:surface/furniture\b
> cdevtest tagsof vintagedelight:strawberry_jam_block
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=vintagedelight:strawberry_jam_block .*block_tags=\S*\bblockrunner:surface/very_sticky\b
> cdevtest tagsof upgrade_aquatic:coralstone
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tagsof id=upgrade_aquatic:coralstone .*block_tags=\S*\bblockrunner:surface/natural_smooth\b
> cdevtest tag block blockrunner:surface/metal
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tag done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=block tag=blockrunner:surface/metal n=[1-9]\d* ids=\S*\bmetalfences:
> cdevtest tag block blockrunner:surface/camouflage
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tag done= 20
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=tag kind=block tag=blockrunner:surface/camouflage n=([3-9]|\d\d+) 
reject \[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=)

